==Description==
The '''Deluxe Crate''' is a very prestigious crate. Like the [[Premium Crate]], it yields more advanced and aesthetically pleasing skins than the [[Basic Crate]]. You are unable to get duplicate skins from this crate, once you have unboxed all the available skins to you. Skins from this crate can appear in the daily shop.

Each skin that can be gotten from the '''Deluxe Crate''' has a rarity which affects how likely you are to unlock the skin and the price when it appears in the daily skin store. In the daily skin store, {{Color|Common}} skins cost {{Robux|255}}, {{Color|Uncommon}} skins {{Robux|360}}, {{Color|Rare}} skins cost {{Robux|360}} and {{Color|Legendary}} skins cost {{Robux|560}}.

==Appearance==
{{Tabber
|Current
|The '''Deluxe Crate''' is a large futuristic black crate with yellow finishing and a golden chevron on the front. It is locked by a card reader. It contains multiple gold coins inside.
|Version 1
|The '''Deluxe Crate''' was a large black crate with yellow finishing and a golden chevron on the front. It was locked by two straps.
}}

==Methods of Obtaining==
===Current Methods===
#Purchasable in the store for {{Robux|200}}.
#Day 28 of [[Login Rewards]].
#0.145% chance from the [[Spin Wheel]].
#Purchasing the [[VIP+]] subscription for the first time and every month after that.

===Former Methods===
#Rank 9 of the [[Frost Invasion Event#Frost Invasion Season Pass|Frost Invasion Season]].
#Rank 7 of the [[Solar Eclipse Event#Solar Eclipse Season Pass|Solar Eclipse Season]].
#Redeeming the [[Codes|code]] "1BILLION" (expired).
#Redeeming the [[Codes|code]] "MERRYXMAS2023" (expired).
#Completing [[Quests#After The Hunt|After The Hunt]] quest after the {{RLinkC|16736381810|Scout Egg Accessory}} ran out of stock.
#Redeeming the [[Badges#Achievement Badges|Triumph Hardcore badge]] in [[Rewards]] while it still existed.
#Purchase the [[Merchandise#School Essentials|Tower Defense T-Shirt]] or [[Merchandise#School Essentials|Tower Defense Backpack]] while it gave out codes.
#*This can be repeated multiple times.
#Chance to appear as the reward for [[Quests#Damage Dealer|Damage Dealer]] weekly quests with a 4,000,000 damage requirement.

